# "Whenever YOU sacrifice a permanent": with the Talent at level 2, Bot2 sacrifices its own Masked Meower to the Meower's
# ability in turn 4 and Bot1's Talent does not trigger (`! Bot1.Target`: no target question for the mill is asked). Bot2's
# graveyard holds only the Meower and the Island it discarded as the cost (2 cards), nothing is milled.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Swamp
Scavenger's Talent
Island x4
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Masked Meower
Island x24

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Scavenger's Talent.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Masked Meower.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Scavenger's Talent.Activate(Ability: Level 2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Battlefield.Masked Meower.Activate
Bot2.Choose(Discard 1 card)
Bot2.Choose(Island)
! Bot1.Target
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 2
Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp; Swamp; Scavenger's Talent
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
